 "note": [
  "Run shapes no Phase 4 recording contains, written by hand so that every rule has a",
  "case that fires it. A rule with no failing case is a rule nobody has seen work.",
  "",
  "The first case is the important one. It is Phase 4's harness defect 3 in miniature:",
  "a run that booted, logged in, photographed a desktop and shut down without running the",
  "journey it was asked for. Under the Phase 4 grader that record was a PASS, because",
  "nothing in it said a journey had been requested. Here it is a FAIL, and the only thing",
  "that changed is that the run declared its intent before it ran.",
  "",
  "'journal' is written verbatim to journal-lastboot.log; the healthy default carries the",
  "five lines the machine dimension looks for."
 ],
